      "node_id": "kg_doc_8",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "\"Orange\" is a song performed by Irish comedian David O'Doherty. It was released on CD in February 2007 as part of his attempts to have a \"Minor\" hit single, preferably at #27 in the charts. The exploits of O'Doherty trying to have this \"hit\" was featured in an episode of his TV series, \"The Modest Adventures of David O'Doherty\".",
